  "summary": {
    "text": "Phi-4-reasoning-vision-15B is a 15-billion-parameter open-weight multimodal reasoning model from Microsoft Research, released on 4 March 2026 under the MIT licence through Hugging Face, GitHub and Microsoft Foundry. It feeds images into the Phi-4-reasoning language backbone through a SigLIP-2 vision encoder and can either reason step by step or answer directly.",
